cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the work via the Zenodo concept DOI minted on first release."
title: "fractal-ann-diagnostics: Intrinsic-dimension descriptors for predicting ANN index failure modes"
abstract: >-
  A diagnostic tool that ingests a vector dataset, computes a panel of
  intrinsic-dimension and fractal descriptors (correlation dimension D₂,
  local intrinsic dimensionality distribution, multifractal spectrum width
  on graph distances), and outputs a workload-classed recommendation among
  HNSW, IVF, flat-NSW, and DiskANN, with a calibrated estimate of recall
  degradation under default parameters. Evaluated on the ANN-benchmarks
  corpus.
authors:
